## What the volcanic isles' people say and are called (VolcanicTheme.life, read through LifePools.of): a forge town
## under a living volcano. Smiths, tinkerers, quarrymen and ash farmers who've learned to read the mountain's moods,
## who sweep ash off the roofs every morning and count the seconds between the rumble and the bang.
